Runtime session diagnostics: bounded guest-frame interval distributions.

GOW_FRAME_DIAG=1 uses the profile frame PC, one steady-clock read per guest frame
and fixed storage; reports five-second windows without per-call timing scopes.
Keeps the FPS overlay independent. Guest intervals are not presentation latency.
Validation: Windows frame-window regressions, call/codegen suites and a 100-second
PT-BR gameplay smoke pass (2,000 VU1 comparisons, zero mismatches). No FPS gain claimed.

